          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Quietum Plus is a product formulated in a scientific manner that provides support for ear and brain health. This is made possible through the process of nourishing the nerves of the ear, improving blood flow to the ears, and preventing oxidative stress.<br><br>Enhancement of the blood flow to the inner ear is one of the primary functions of Quietum Plus. It makes sure that there is sufficient supply of oxygen and vital nutrients to the auditory system. This will aid in the restoration of damaged hair cells in the cochlea.<br><br>Furthermore, Quietum Plus is comprised of strong antioxidants, which work to inhibit inflammation and any form of free radicals. This helps prevent any further degradation of the auditory nerves and guards against age-induced hearing loss. Also, by reducing any forms of inflammation, this supplement helps eliminate any problems such as tinnitus.<br><br>Formula also ensures that you have good brain health due to its ability to maintain neurotransmitter balance and brain functioning. Since there is a strong connection between your brain and your ears, maintaining clear neural pathways will enable you to hear much better.<br><br>Also, Quietum Plus ensures proper regulation of the earwax in your ears, thereby protecting them from infections and any other form of harm. Though earwax is important in keeping dust and germs away from your ears, excess earwax in the ears may be harmful.<br><br>Another mechanism of how Quietum Plus functions is through reducing stress and anxiety, which are known to be associated with tinnitus and hearing problems. There are some natural ingredients in this supplement, which have relaxing effects, helping a person to relax and sleep better while decreasing the levels of cortisol.<br><br>Finally, the auditory nerve channels are enhanced by Quietum Plus, which enhances the ability of the brain to interpret sound signals. The end product is sharper hearing, enhanced concentration, and overall good auditory processing. Quietum Plus ensures that all aspects of ear and brain health are well taken care of.<br>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
