          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b>Quietum Plus </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement designed to support hearing wellness, cognitive health, and general well-being. Its reported formulation includes botanical ingredients, vitamins, zinc, and amino acids. However, the benefits of the complete formula have not been established by strong clinical evidence, and its ingredients should be verified against the current product label.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Hearing Wellness –</b>&nbsp;Quietum Plus is promoted for adults interested in maintaining hearing wellness. Hearing health depends on several factors, including age, noise exposure, and underlying medical conditions. Although some ingredients are studied for their biological effects, there is insufficient evidence that Quietum Plus improves hearing sensitivity or reverses hearing los.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Promotes General Cognitive Wellness– </b>Some reported ingredients, including L-tyrosine and Mucuna pruriens, are associated with research into brain chemistry and neurological processes. However, research on individual compounds does not establish that Quietum Plus improves memory, concentration, or cognitive performance.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Provides Essential Nutritional Support –</b>&nbsp;The reported formula includes zinc and vitamins. These nutrients play important roles in normal bodily functions, including immune activity and cellular metabolism. Their benefits depend on the actual amounts present and a person's nutritional needs; additional supplementation does not automatically improve hearing or general health.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅May Support Energy Levels– </b>Some weight-management supplements contain caffeine or other stimulant ingredients that can temporarily increase alertness. Whether VittaBurn provides this effect depends on its actual ingredients and amounts. Products containing stimulants may also cause nervousness, sleep disturbances, or a rapid heartbeat in some people.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Normal Nervous-System Function –</b>&nbsp;The nervous system helps the brain process sensory information, including sound. Certain nutrients contribute to normal neurological function, while some botanical compounds have been investigated for their effects on the nervous system. Nevertheless, Quietum Plus has not been established as a treatment for auditory nerve problems.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Contains Ingredients Studied for Antioxidant Activity –</b>&nbsp;Some plant-derived compounds are studied for their potential antioxidant properties. Antioxidants help protect cells from oxidative stress under normal biological conditions. However, these general properties do not prove that Quietum Plus protects the inner ear or prevents age-related hearing changes.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Complements a Healthy Lifestyle –&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>Healthy hearing and overall wellness benefit from practical habits, including balanced nutrition, adequate sleep, and limiting exposure to excessive noise. Quietum Plus may be considered by some adults as part of a wellness routine, provided its ingredients are appropriate for them. It should not replace healthy habits or recommended medical care.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Encourages Awareness of Hearing Protection –</b>&nbsp;Learning about hearing health can encourage people to use ear protection around loud machinery or music and to seek professional evaluation when hearing changes occur. These measures are more directly relevant to preventing noise-related hearing damage than relying on an unproven supplement.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅OOffers a Convenient Supplement Format –</b>&nbsp;Quietum Plus is sold as a dietary supplement for people who prefer a packaged wellness product. Before use, review the recommended serving, ingredient quantities, allergens, and safety warnings. Convenience alone does not establish that a supplement is effective.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports a Broader Wellness Routine –</b>&nbsp;General well-being involves many interconnected factors, including nutrition, physical activity, sleep, stress management, and appropriate healthcare. Quietum Plus should be viewed, at most, as a potential addition to an individual wellness plan rather than a stand-alone solution for hearing or cognitive concerns.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Provides an Opportunity to Review Nutritional Needs – </b>Checking a supplement's ingredient list can help consumers identify what they are taking and whether it is suitable for them. A healthcare professional can help determine whether additional nutrients are necessary and whether any ingredients could interact with current medication.</span></div></div><div><div><br></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
